      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d03e5b73916bed83",
      "translationZh": "查看由 Basel Mousi、Fahim Dalvi、Shammur Chowdhury、Firoj Alam 和 Nadir Durrani 撰写的论文《说出来，读来却不同：多模态模型中的跨模态不稳定性》的 PDF",
